    <li><a href="https://www.meta.com/help/subscriptions/1021145227643680/">Meta subscriptions help</a>, for the Power and Max allowances</li>
    <li><a href="https://dev.meta.ai/docs/overview">Meta Model API documentation</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://models.dev">models.dev</a>, for the standard and contributor rate cards</li>
  </ul></div>
